Spec: Features

Purpose:
  One directory per screen area; each holds its screen, its provider set and its widgets.

Structure:
  ./shell: Routing, splash, tab shell, deep links and the ride-saved notice
  ./onboarding: First-run name, photo and activity
  ./home: Home tab with stats, recent rides, favourites and the ride start
  ./timer: Pre-ride countdown
  ./active_ride: Live ride screen and its dialogs
  ./history: History tab, ride detail, edit, filter and route comparison
  ./settings: Settings tab
  ./profile: Profile name and photos
  ./follow: Following a saved route

Must:
  A feature reaches data only through repositories and providers.
  Screens with the fixed dark chrome (countdown, ride, follow) keep that palette in both themes.
